{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S05仅停留18秒，却同时出现多组未标注“到时出现”的感受词，实际扫读时比X更容易显得拥挤。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事拆成短而有因果关系的句子，并用加亮词让观众迅速抓住每段的心理重点：为什么靠近、为什么收住、为什么害怕、后来又为什么愿意坦然面对。小号感受词和按音乐进程出现的提示，让情绪落实到具体的声响、身体感受和细微变化；反复出现的船、水、摇荡与停泊意象也让前后形成呼应。相比之下，X虽然叙述完整、阅读负担相对均匀，但重点缺少视觉突出，右侧短词较像并列的情绪标签，人物心理的递进和音乐细节的结合不如Y鲜明。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d0d31264-5c32-46b4-8822-80edbabd2d90", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T181738482107Z", "elapsed_seconds": 135.766, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:19:54.253352+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "403487150227014761a744835c90a88fc95d0626e2a71369aec789e0e7d4410a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch